  m_text: 'F  -> Flame Spell ON/OFF (required to cast FireBall)

    Right Click
    -> Fire Ball

    Q -> Reignite


    E -> Interact


    B -> Bag (inventory)


    C
    -> Consume (only with a consumable equipped to the left hand slot)


    Spoiler
    warning for the next pages on how to do pretty much everything there is to do
    in the game ----------------------------->'
