  m_text: 'The Eye Deer can be "blinded" by using Reignite veery close to it.


    Likewise,
    the Shadow Hands that come close to steal your flame can be vanquished by casting
    Reignite when close enough.


    Skeletons can be killed with normal Fire Balls,
    but Reignite doesn''t have any effect on them.


    Alchemy -------------------------------------------------------------------->'
